📊 Superstore Sales Dashboard | Microsoft Excel

📌 Project Overview

This project is an interactive Sales Dashboard built in Microsoft Excel using the Sample Superstore dataset.

The dashboard transforms raw sales data into meaningful business insights through KPI Cards, Pivot Tables, Pivot Charts, and Interactive Slicers.

It helps users analyze sales performance, customer behavior, product performance, regional sales, and monthly sales trends in an easy-to-understand visual format.

