📈 Dashboard Features :

- 📊 Total Sales KPI
- 💰 Total Profit KPI
- 📦 Total Orders KPI
- 🛒 Total Quantity KPI
- 📅 Monthly Sales Trend Analysis
- 🌍 Sales by Region
- 📂 Sales & Profit by Category
- 🏆 Top 5 Products by Sales
- 👥 Top 10 Customers by Sales
- 🎛️ Interactive Slicers (Category, Region, Segment & Year)

📊 Key Business Insights :

- Technology generated the highest overall sales among all product categories.
- Sales performance varied across different regions, highlighting differences in regional contribution.
- A small group of customers contributed significantly to overall sales.
- Monthly sales trends showed fluctuations throughout the year, helping identify high and low-performing months.
- Interactive slicers allow users to analyze sales performance by Category, Region, Segment, and Year.

🎯 About This Project :

> This project was built as part of my Data Analytics portfolio to strengthen my
Microsoft Excel skills and gain hands-on experience in creating interactive business dashboards.

> The objective was to transform raw sales data into meaningful insights using Excel's analytical and visualization features, 
similar to how business reports are created in real organizations.

